{
	"cell_id": 3391536610896426838,
	"cells": [
		{
			"cell_id": 9970128145502107243,
			"cell_origin": "client",
			"cell_type": "latex",
			"cells": [
				{
					"cell_id": 849547814219720497,
					"cell_origin": "client",
					"cell_type": "latex_view",
					"source": "\\section*{Automatic multi-term simplification}\n\nThis notebook illustrates how the automatic multi-term simplification algorithm \\algo{meld} can\nbe used in a \\verb|post_process| function to simplify expressions immediately. For simpler computations,\nor computations that are already working and for which you do not want to show these simplifications\nat every step, this can be useful."
				}
			],
			"hidden": true,
			"source": "\\section*{Automatic multi-term simplification}\n\nThis notebook illustrates how the automatic multi-term simplification algorithm \\algo{meld} can\nbe used in a \\verb|post_process| function to simplify expressions immediately. For simpler computations,\nor computations that are already working and for which you do not want to show these simplifications\nat every step, this can be useful."
		},
		{
			"cell_id": 16589852709921553693,
			"cell_origin": "client",
			"cell_type": "input",
			"source": "def post_process(ex):\n    meld(ex)\n    collect_terms(ex)"
		},
		{
			"cell_id": 1137909878511905740,
			"cell_origin": "client",
			"cell_type": "input",
			"cells": [
				{
					"cell_id": 11544389263806478421,
					"cell_origin": "server",
					"cell_type": "latex_view",
					"source": "\\begin{dmath*}{}\\text{Property TableauSymmetry attached to~}R_{a b c d}.\\end{dmath*}"
				}
			],
			"source": "R_{a b c d}::RiemannTensor;"
		},
		{
			"cell_id": 12533871357581158101,
			"cell_origin": "client",
			"cell_type": "latex",
			"cells": [
				{
					"cell_id": 6517669635204007728,
					"cell_origin": "client",
					"cell_type": "latex_view",
					"source": "By the first Bianchi identity, the sum of cyclic permutations of three indices is zero:"
				}
			],
			"hidden": true,
			"source": "By the first Bianchi identity, the sum of cyclic permutations of three indices is zero:"
		},
		{
			"cell_id": 10442559150589961051,
			"cell_origin": "client",
			"cell_type": "input",
			"cells": [
				{
					"cell_id": 1797005253894748205,
					"cell_origin": "server",
					"cell_type": "latex_view",
					"cells": [
						{
							"cell_id": 3565135340958588219,
							"cell_origin": "server",
							"cell_type": "input_form",
							"source": "0"
						}
					],
					"source": "\\begin{dmath*}{}0\\,\\end{dmath*}"
				}
			],
			"source": "ex:=R_{a b c d} + R_{b c a d} + R_{c a b d};"
		},
		{
			"cell_id": 12629315822287932510,
			"cell_origin": "client",
			"cell_type": "latex",
			"cells": [
				{
					"cell_id": 3563831100510488754,
					"cell_origin": "client",
					"cell_type": "latex_view",
					"source": "Let's define a fully anti-symmetric tensor $A^{a b c}$ and a fully symmetric tensor $S^{a b c}$:"
				}
			],
			"hidden": true,
			"source": "Let's define a fully anti-symmetric tensor $A^{a b c}$ and a fully symmetric tensor $S^{a b c}$:"
		},
		{
			"cell_id": 17665426107502293019,
			"cell_origin": "client",
			"cell_type": "input",
			"cells": [
				{
					"cell_id": 11474805042065934960,
					"cell_origin": "server",
					"cell_type": "latex_view",
					"source": "\\begin{dmath*}{}\\text{Property AntiSymmetric attached to~}A^{a b c}.\\end{dmath*}"
				}
			],
			"source": "A^{a b c}::AntiSymmetric;"
		},
		{
			"cell_id": 11231869119195730671,
			"cell_origin": "client",
			"cell_type": "input",
			"cells": [
				{
					"cell_id": 490281229518119505,
					"cell_origin": "server",
					"cell_type": "latex_view",
					"source": "\\begin{dmath*}{}\\text{Property Symmetric attached to~}S_{a b c}.\\end{dmath*}"
				}
			],
			"source": "S_{a b c}::Symmetric;"
		},
		{
			"cell_id": 3333087813958793321,
			"cell_origin": "client",
			"cell_type": "latex",
			"cells": [
				{
					"cell_id": 6469369898920164541,
					"cell_origin": "client",
					"cell_type": "latex_view",
					"source": "Contracting a fully anti-symmetric tensor with the Riemann tensor leads to the first Bianchi identity again, so should vanish:"
				}
			],
			"hidden": true,
			"source": "Contracting a fully anti-symmetric tensor with the Riemann tensor leads to the first Bianchi identity again, so should vanish:"
		},
		{
			"cell_id": 15440997254477550604,
			"cell_origin": "client",
			"cell_type": "input",
			"cells": [
				{
					"cell_id": 11001196856597142214,
					"cell_origin": "server",
					"cell_type": "latex_view",
					"cells": [
						{
							"cell_id": 25436067523302231,
							"cell_origin": "server",
							"cell_type": "input_form",
							"source": "0"
						}
					],
					"source": "\\begin{dmath*}{}0\\,\\end{dmath*}"
				}
			],
			"source": "ex:=R_{a b c d} A^{a b c};"
		},
		{
			"cell_id": 6001193804290926265,
			"cell_origin": "client",
			"cell_type": "input",
			"cells": [
				{
					"cell_id": 45661992972395886,
					"cell_origin": "server",
					"cell_type": "latex_view",
					"cells": [
						{
							"cell_id": 17689866166143150878,
							"cell_origin": "server",
							"cell_type": "input_form",
							"source": "2A^{a b c} S_{a b c}"
						}
					],
					"source": "\\begin{dmath*}{}2\\,A^{a b c} S_{a b c}\\end{dmath*}"
				}
			],
			"source": "ex:= (A^{a b c} + A^{c a b}) S_{a b c};"
		},
		{
			"cell_id": 16876922475692815709,
			"cell_origin": "client",
			"cell_type": "latex",
			"cells": [
				{
					"cell_id": 13624571496100903213,
					"cell_origin": "client",
					"cell_type": "latex_view",
					"source": "Note that the post-processing function only applies the meld algorithm once, so the best it could do was to combine\nthe two anti-symmetric tensors. If you apply meld again, it sees the zero:"
				}
			],
			"hidden": true,
			"source": "Note that the post-processing function only applies the meld algorithm once, so the best it could do was to combine\nthe two anti-symmetric tensors. If you apply meld again, it sees the zero:"
		},
		{
			"cell_id": 14929753163657422384,
			"cell_origin": "client",
			"cell_type": "input",
			"cells": [
				{
					"cell_id": 13490810205934188663,
					"cell_origin": "server",
					"cell_type": "latex_view",
					"cells": [
						{
							"cell_id": 13659847992161685603,
							"cell_origin": "server",
							"cell_type": "input_form",
							"source": "0"
						}
					],
					"source": "\\begin{dmath*}{}0\\,\\end{dmath*}"
				}
			],
			"source": "meld(ex, repeat=True);"
		},
		{
			"cell_id": 18386348912926115865,
			"cell_origin": "client",
			"cell_type": "latex",
			"cells": [
				{
					"cell_id": 7327223332453054829,
					"cell_origin": "client",
					"cell_type": "latex_view",
					"source": "You could have achieved the above by instead using a \\verb|converge| construction inside the post-processing function."
				}
			],
			"hidden": true,
			"source": "You could have achieved the above by instead using a \\verb|converge| construction inside the post-processing function."
		},
		{
			"cell_id": 18005777072927410222,
			"cell_origin": "client",
			"cell_type": "latex",
			"cells": [
				{
					"cell_id": 7023982170874905829,
					"cell_origin": "client",
					"cell_type": "latex_view",
					"source": "Some other assorted examples now. Meld will automatically factor out scalar expressions:"
				}
			],
			"hidden": true,
			"source": "Some other assorted examples now. Meld will automatically factor out scalar expressions:"
		},
		{
			"cell_id": 10182337157813236277,
			"cell_origin": "client",
			"cell_type": "input",
			"cells": [
				{
					"cell_id": 8263710583809205595,
					"cell_origin": "server",
					"cell_type": "latex_view",
					"cells": [
						{
							"cell_id": 15033314569842213967,
							"cell_origin": "server",
							"cell_type": "input_form",
							"source": "(a-b) A^{a b c}"
						}
					],
					"source": "\\begin{dmath*}{}\\left(a\\discretionary{}{}{}-\\,b\\right) A^{a b c}\\end{dmath*}"
				}
			],
			"source": "ex:= a A^{a b c} + b A^{b a c};"
		},
		{
			"cell_id": 5732189980976377100,
			"cell_origin": "client",
			"cell_type": "latex",
			"cells": [
				{
					"cell_id": 7912009819955371159,
					"cell_origin": "client",
					"cell_type": "latex_view",
					"source": "Not all expressions quadratic in the Riemann tensor are independent:"
				}
			],
			"hidden": true,
			"source": "Not all expressions quadratic in the Riemann tensor are independent:"
		},
		{
			"cell_id": 2655562479605535632,
			"cell_origin": "client",
			"cell_type": "input",
			"cells": [
				{
					"cell_id": 13560884064948886027,
					"cell_origin": "server",
					"cell_type": "latex_view",
					"cells": [
						{
							"cell_id": 14509520962086721391,
							"cell_origin": "server",
							"cell_type": "input_form",
							"source": " 3/2 R_{a b c d} R_{a b c d}"
						}
					],
					"source": "\\begin{dmath*}{}\\frac{3}{2}\\,R_{a b c d} R_{a b c d}\\end{dmath*}"
				}
			],
			"source": "ex:=R_{a b c d} R_{a b c d} + R_{a b c d} R_{a c b d};"
		},
		{
